[bui]</*_>
[bold]<*>
[italic]</>
[underline]<_>

[icon]<:>

[red]<#red>

[nolink]<!>

[nofmt1]<>
[nofmt2]< >

[fg]<#000000>
[bg]<\ffffff>
[fgbg]<#000000\ffffff>

[custom]<@custom-fmt>

just some [highlighted]</!> text

I like this stuff
... very much so ...


LINK TO SOMETHING ELSE

    [something]<![sick][crazy]>  => would show as 'something' but link to 'sick' and 'crazy'

    [abc]<[def]{ content of def; this will not work }> { content of abc }


SYNONYMS

    [blah]<[blahh][bla]> {}



ICONS

    <:[icon]:[icon2]>[title]{}

    OLD///TRASH: [icon]:[icon 2]:[title] {}
    OLD///TRASH: [title]<:[icon][icon 2]> {}



FORMATTING

    BOLD            <*>[text]
    ITALIC          </>[text]
    UNDERLINE       <_>[text]
    CODE            <$>[text]
    COLOR FG        <#ffffff>[text]
    COLOR BG        <\ffffff>[text]
    FILE            <%[../images/stickman.png]>[text]
    URL             <?[https://www.gentoo.org]>[text]
    DO NOT LINK     <!>[text]
    LINK MORE       <[link2][link3]>[text]                  (link 1 is 'text')
    SYNONYM         <+[synonym]>[text]
    CUSTOM FORMAT   <@[custom]>[text]


    BOLD            [text]<*>
    ITALIC          [text]</>
    UNDERLINE       [text]<_>
    CODE            [text]<$>
    COLOR FG        [text]<#ffffff>
    COLOR BG        [text]<\ffffff>
    FILE            [text]<%[../images/stickman.png]>
    URL             [text]<?[https://www.gentoo.org]>
    DO NOT LINK     [text]<!>
    LINK MORE       [text]<[link2][link3]>                 (link 1 is 'text')
    SYONNYM         [text]<+[synonym]>
    CUSTOM FORMAT   [text]<@[custom]>

    TIME            [YYYY-MM-DD]<@YYYY-MM-DD>



CUSTOM FORMATS

    @format-name<flags>



EXAMPLE USAGE

    LINK RENAME         [text]<![link]>
    URL                 [url]<_%[https://some.url]#1f1fff>
    URL FORMAT          URL <_#1f1fff>
    URL USING FORMAT    [URL]<@URL%[https://some.url]>


NOTE FLAGS

    ALL FROM ABOVE + BELOW

    UNIQUE NOTE REQUIREMENT         [title]<+> {}
    ICON                            [note]<:[icon]> {}


